  "worked_solution": "The sentence *\"The function $g$ maps the set $X$ to the set of rational numbers\"* is equivalent to the following symbolic notation:\n\n$\\,$ $g:X\\to Q$\n\nHere, the domain of $g$ is $X,$ and the codomain of $g$ is $Q.$",
